RETURN RESULT

@M_KOJO_MESSAGE_COM_K106_300_1
;-------------------------------------------------
;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
LOCAL = 1
;-------------------------------------------------
IF LOCAL
	IF TFLAG:193 == -3 ;custom code, hate mark 3
		RETURN
	ENDIF
	SELECTCASE TFLAG:193
	CASE 1
		IF TALENT:恋人
			IF RAND:3 == 0
				PRINTFORMDW You ask Sumireko to show off some of her powers.
				PRINTFORMW 「Maybe I should practice teleportation!」
				PRINTFORMW 「Hngnghngh～ ...Haa!!!」
				PRINTFORMDW You suddenly feel an overwhelming urge to urinate!
				PRINTFORMW 「"Relieve the urge to pee", Esper Mami style!」
				PRINTFORMDW What the hell is this girl doing?!
			ELSEIF RAND:2 == 0
				PRINTFORMDW You ask Sumireko for her recommended places to visit in Gensokyo.
				PRINTFORMW 「Anywhere is fine as long as it's with you...」
				PRINTFORMW 「Err, I—I mean, n—nothing comes to mind!」
				PRINTFORMDW How odd. Isn't that basically the same answer?
				PRINTFORMW 「Geez... You idiot...」
			ELSE
				PRINTFORMDW You talk about personal matters with Sumireko...
				PRINTFORMDW How many kids do you want?
				PRINTFORMW 「Whaaa--?! W—Well... I'd want to have... A daughter, if possible...」
				PRINTFORMDW Sumireko admits her true desires in a murmur...
				PRINTFORMW 「B—But it's far too early for that, dummy!」
			ENDIF
		ELSEIF TALENT:恋慕
			IF RAND:3 == 0
				PRINTFORMDW You ask Sumireko to show off some of her psychic powers.
				PRINTFORMW 「Maybe I should brainwash you...」
				PRINTFORMW 「Ooooohhh... Fall in love with me～... Fall in love with meeee～」
				PRINTFORMDW  
				PRINTFORMW 「...H-Huh, nothing happened... My bad, j-just forget it...」
				PRINTFORMDW Sumireko turns bright red.
			ELSEIF RAND:2 == 0
				PRINTFORMDW You ask Sumireko for her recommended places to visit in Gensokyo.
				PRINTFORMW 「Hakurei Shrine often attracts a lot of interesting people.」
				PRINTFORMDW I know... And they're all so cute...
				PRINTFORMW 「...Grrrr.」
			ELSE
				PRINTFORMDW You talk about personal matters with Sumireko.
				PRINTFORMDW Don't you ever wear contact lenses?
				PRINTFORMW 「Are you seriously telling a girl known for wearing glasses to take them off? Are you trying to start something?」
				PRINTFORMDW Realizing how careless that question was, you apologize to her.
				PRINTFORMW 「That's better. I'm glad you're paying attention.」
			ENDIF
		ELSEIF TALENT:思慕
			IF RAND:3 == 0
				PRINTFORMDW You ask Sumireko if she can show off some of her psychic powers.
				PRINTFORMW 「How about I read your mind, that should be easy-peasy.」
				PRINTFORMW 「Hngnghngh... Oh! You like Tokimeki Memorial?」
				PRINTFORMW 「And your favorite character is Kisaragi-san... You've got good taste!」
				PRINTFORMDW I hope Director Kojima is doing well...
			ELSEIF RAND:2 == 0
				PRINTFORMDW You ask Sumireko for her recommended places to visit in Gensokyo.
				PRINTFORMW 「A walk around the Misty Lake calms the mind.」
				PRINTFORMDW Yeah, and the water there is perfect for making sake...
				PRINTFORMW 「...I'm going to pretend I didn't hear that... I'm a minor, y'know!」
				;don't know if she's referring to herself or you
			ELSE
				PRINTFORMDW You talk about personal matters with Sumireko.
				PRINTFORMDW I don't think it's a good idea to sleep through the entire class.
				PRINTFORMW 「It's cuz classes are suuuuch a bore!」
				IF CFLAG:106:K106_STRANGERS
					PRINTFORMW 「If only I could live here like you, I'd never have to go to school again...!」
					PRINTFORMDW At this rate, it sounds like she might flunk out anyway...
				ELSE
					PRINTFORMW 「You have no right to nitpick about that when your grades are worse than mine.」
					PRINTFORMW 「That's right, get better grades first, then speak up!」
					PRINTFORMDW Ugh, the nerve of this girl! If only you could use time stop in reality, you'd put her in her place...
				ENDIF
			ENDIF
		ELSE
			IF RAND:3 == 0
				PRINTFORMDW You ask Sumireko to show off some of her psychic powers.
				PRINTFORMDW Sumireko-kun, would you mind a little favor...?
				PRINTFORMW 「Hmm... 'Kay, sure, but only this once, ok?」
				PRINTFORMW 「Woosh～ Hahaha!」
				PRINTFORMDW Can you not make fun of me...? I know you're better than that.
				PRINTFORMW 「For one, my powers are not for show, and I don't feel like showing off willy-nilly just for your sake.」
				;I saw what this is referencing, however i don't know the niche so it's a literal translation.
			ELSEIF RAND:2 == 0
				PRINTFORMDW You ask Sumireko for her recommended places to visit in Gensokyo.
				PRINTFORMW 「Have you heard of Kourindou? The owner, Rinnosuke-san, is very handsome.」
				PRINTFORMDW ...I don't think I've ever seen him before.
				PRINTFORMW 「Huuuh... You sure he doesn't just hate you or something?」
			ELSE
				PRINTFORMDW You talk about personal matters with Sumireko.
				PRINTFORMDW ...What the hell is with that cape?
				PRINTFORMW 「Isn't it juuust cool? Ta-da!」 
				PRINTFORMDW You'll get caught in a jet turbine if you keep wearing that thing.
				PRINTFORMW 「Bah! I'm not trying to be a hero here, anyhow...」
			ENDIF
		ENDIF
	CASE 0
		IF TALENT:恋人
			IF RAND:4 == 0
				PRINTFORMW 「Chatting up girls so casually again, I see...」
				PRINTFORMW 「Don't do it to anyone but me, okay?」
				PRINTFORMDW Sumireko smiles wryly...
			ELSEIF RAND:3 == 0
				PRINTFORMW 「Oooh, I know that one!」
				PRINTFORMW 「That's pretty funny!」
				PRINTFORMDW Sumireko seems to by enjoying herself...
			ELSEIF RAND:2 == 0
				PRINTFORMDW Sumireko is listening with a wide grin.
				PRINTFORMW 「Fufufu, that sure is a thing～」
			ELSE
				PRINTFORMDW Sumireko fixes her gaze at you...
				PRINTFORMW 「What's wrong? Go on, tell me more...」
			ENDIF
		ELSEIF TALENT:恋慕
			IF RAND:5 == 0
				PRINTFORMW 「...Do you normally talk to other girls that way? Seriously...」
				PRINTFORMDW Sumireko looks a little embarrassed.
			ELSEIF RAND:4 == 0
				PRINTFORMDW Sumireko is making small talk with you.
				PRINTFORMW 「Huuuh, you think so too, eh?」
				PRINTFORMW 「I think we might just hit it off pretty well, you and me.」
			ELSEIF RAND:3 == 0
				PRINTFORMDW Sumireko is making small talk with you.
				PRINTFORMW 「Whaaat? What makes you think *that*?」
			ELSEIF RAND:2 == 0
				PRINTFORMDW Sumireko seems sort of bothered the moment you mention a different girl in the conversation.
				PRINTFORMW 「...You sure are quite popular with the ladies, huh?」
				PRINTFORMW 「'Not really'? Well, what do I care, just do what you want I guess...」
			ELSE
				PRINTFORMDW Sumireko is nodding along during your conversation.
				PRINTFORMW 「Once again, it's the high school girls who are truly invincible...」
			ENDIF
		ELSEIF TALENT:思慕
			IF RAND:5 == 0
				PRINTFORMW 「I see you've been having a hard time yourself.」
				PRINTFORMDW Sumireko nods along.
			ELSEIF RAND:4 == 0
				PRINTFORMW 「Huuuh... Now that's interesting.」
				PRINTFORMDW Sumireko seems to enjoy the conversation...
			ELSEIF RAND:3 == 0
				PRINTFORMW 「That sounds awfully irrational to me.」
				PRINTFORMW 「If only I was there with my psychic powers...」
				PRINTFORMDW Sumireko flashes a dangerous grin on her face...
			ELSEIF RAND:2 == 0
				PRINTFORMW 「You've been talking a lot more lately, don't you think?」
				PRINTFORMW 「Maybe it just shows the results of my training, who knows.」
				PRINTFORMDW Sumireko grins smugly...
			ELSE
				PRINTFORMW 「Hmm... So what happened next?」
				PRINTFORMDW Sumireko listens with interest to your story...
			ENDIF
		ELSE
			IF RAND:5 == 0
				PRINTFORMW 「Meh, who cares. Better listen to this, you know that one time when Reimu-cchi...」
				PRINTFORMDW Sumireko is not paying attention to what you're saying...
			ELSEIF RAND:4 == 0
				PRINTFORMW 「What a lame story.」
				PRINTFORMDW Sumireko is making fun of you.
			ELSEIF RAND:3 == 0
				PRINTFORMW 「You should try speaking more clearly.」
				PRINTFORMDW Sumireko nitpicks your story.
			ELSEIF RAND:2 == 0
				PRINTFORMW 「I feel like I've heard that one before...」
				PRINTFORMDW Sumireko seems bored.
			ELSE
				PRINTFORMW 「Wow... That sure sounds like sexual harassment to me!」
				PRINTFORMDW Sumireko looks disgusted.
			ENDIF
		ENDIF
	CASEELSE
		IF TALENT:恋人
			PRINTFORMW 「That same old story again...」
			PRINTFORMW 「%CALLNAME:MASTER%, aren't you a little tired?」
			PRINTFORMDW Sumireko shows concern for you.
		ELSEIF TALENT:思慕 || TALENT:恋慕
			PRINTFORMW 「Uh, %SPLIT_G("is that the same story from before:didn't you already say that")%?」
			PRINTFORMDW Sumireko seems a little bored.
		ELSE
			PRINTFORMW 「The same story...」
			PRINTFORMW 「You know, I'm sick of people with little to say.」
			PRINTFORMDW Sumireko belittles you, giving you a cold stare.
		ENDIF
	ENDSELECT
ENDIF
RETURN 1
