;TFLAG:194(1=ノーパンしゃぶしゃぶ 2=禁断のメニュー 31=ドーピングコンソメスープ 30=モッツァレラチーズとトマトのサラダ 34=ギンギー料理
;TCVAR:MASTER:308(bit0=濃い味 bit1=薄味 bit3=激辛 bit4=激甘 bit5=わさび bit6=激酸っぱ
;==================================================
@M_KOJO_MESSAGE_COM_K106_414
CALL M_KOJO_MESSAGE_COM_K106_414_1
RETURN RESULT

@M_KOJO_MESSAGE_COM_K106_414_1
;-------------------------------------------------
;記入チェック（=0, 非表示、1, 表示）
LOCAL = 1
;-------------------------------------------------
IF LOCAL
	SELECTCASE TFLAG:193
	CASE 1
		IF TALENT:恋人
			PRINTFORMW 「Here, say aahh～」
			PRINTFORMDW Sumireko holds out a spoonful of food in front of you.
			PRINTFORMDW Opening your mouth, you let her feed you.
			PRINTFORMW 「T-This is kind of embarrassing...」
			PRINTFORMDW Sumireko lets out an awkward giggle...
		ELSEIF TALENT:思慕 || TALENT:恋慕
			PRINTFORMW 「Don't tell me... you actually want to %SPLIT_G("domesticate me with your food:feed me")%?」
			PRINTFORMW 「Alas, I won't give in so easily!」
			PRINTFORMDW Despite her words, Sumireko happily gobbles up the food...
		ELSE
			PRINTFORMW 「Wait, you made this?!」
			PRINTFORMW 「Huuh... All that feminine power is wasted on you...」
			PRINTFORMDW Sumireko looks at you in surprise...
		ENDIF
	CASE 0
		IF TALENT:恋人
			PRINTFORMW 「I think I got a little chubby around my belly as of late...」
			PRINTFORMW 「But I just can't help it! All this food is way too delicious!」
			PRINTFORMDW Sumireko seems rather happy with herself...
		ELSEIF TALENT:思慕 || TALENT:恋慕 || !IS_MALE(MASTER)
			PRINTFORMW 「Yup, it's delicious!」
			PRINTFORMW 「It just gives off that strong vibe of a normie food.」
			PRINTFORMDW Sumireko doesn't bother elaborating on what she meant by that, but it appears she's enjoying her meal.
		ELSE
			PRINTFORMW 「So this is a man's cooking...」
			PRINTFORMDW Sumireko is eating the food with a blank expression on her face.
		ENDIF
	CASEELSE
		IF TALENT:恋人
			PRINTFORMW 「I'm sad to say this, but my boyfriend's food isn't very good...」
			PRINTFORMW 「Oh nooo...! All these anxieties about our future life, they're overwhelming meee...!」
			PRINTFORMDW Sumireko appears to be quite worried...
		ELSEIF TALENT:思慕 || TALENT:恋慕
			PRINTFORMW 「This food is garbage! It's like having the worst things that the world has to offer all competing with each other in one hellish cacophony!」
			PRINTFORMDW Looks like it was so bad, Sumireko is actually freaking out...
		ELSE
			PRINTFORMW 「This tastes like the inedible part in crabs...」
			PRINTFORMDW After barely touching the dish, Sumireko promptly rejects it...
		ENDIF
	ENDSELECT
ENDIF
RETURN 1
